        "client_msg_id": "91747142-423b-44ea-b440-9d82099d0d40",
        "text": "\"The Spherical Cow We Forgot We Were Riding\" \u2014 that is a great title.  If you're in the mood <@UGWUJUZHT>, may or may not be your style, I would love to push on the assertion, \"Functional programming cannot express this  [data flow] without leaving the paradigm. The workarounds (callbacks, futures, reactive streams) are all ways of bolting asynchrony onto a fundamentally synchronous notation.\"",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1774982848.103119",
        "parent_user_id": "UGWUJUZHT",
        "blocks": [
